=BC1a =CD=BCp">**</span>. This indicates that a smaller number of high-stre=
ngth concrete samples pull the average above the median. Strength values ra=
nged from approximately 2.33 MPa to 82.60 MPa.</div><div class=3D"cm-line">=
<br></div><div class=3D"cm-line"><span class=3D"=CD=BCr =CD=BCp">###</span>=
