n and Recommended Mix</span></div><div class=3D"cm-line"> The optimisation =
analysis evaluated 374 observed candidate recipes using illustrative ingred=
ient prices. Recipe 359 was identified as the lowest-cost candidate meeting=
 the conservative predicted-strength screening threshold of 48.9 MPa.</div>=
<div class=3D"cm-line"><br></div><div class=3D"cm-line"> Its predicted comp=
ressive strength was <span class=3D"=CD=BC1a =CD=BCp">**</span><span class=
