ith an estimated ingredient cost of <span class=3D"=CD=BC1a =CD=BCp">**</sp=
an><span class=3D"=CD=BC1a">=C2=A3107.98 per cubic metre</span><span class=
=3D"=CD=BC1a =CD=BCp">**</span>. This exceeds the required 40 MPa target by=
 12.16 MPa.</div><div class=3D"cm-line"><br></div><div class=3D"cm-line"> T=
he recommendation is based on the available candidate recipes and assumed i=
ngredient prices. Actual supplier quotations, production considerations and=
 laboratory testing are required before commercial adoption.</div><div clas=
